      "message": "For the host test, we needed to add some shared libraries in data_libs\n\n```\nrust_test_host {\n    name: \"avmdtool_tests\",\n    srcs: [\"tests/*_test.rs\"],\n    test_suites: [\"general-tests\"],\n    prefer_rlib: true,\n    rustlibs: [\n        \"libanyhow\",\n    ],\n    data: [\"tests/data/*\"],\n    data_bins: [\"avmdtool\"],\n    data_libs: [\n        \"libcrypto\",\n        \"libz\",\n    ],\n}\n```",
